---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: contentData.series
  size: 1
  alias: series
permalink: "/series/{{ series.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ series.title }}"
---
{% from "components.njk" import storyCard, filterBar %}
<div class="container page-main"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">首页</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">{{ series.title }}</span></nav><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">场景系列 {{ '%02d' | format(series.order) }}</p><h1>{{ series.title }}</h1><p class="lead">{{ series.summary }}</p>{% if series.description %}<p>{{ series.description }}</p>{% endif %}<span class="small">{{ series.publishedStories.length }} 篇完整故事 · {{ series.stories.length - series.publishedStories.length }} 篇大纲预告</span></header>
{{ filterBar(series.slug, false, contentData.series, taxonomy.axes.tags.items) }}
{% if series.stories.length %}<div class="story-list" data-filter-list>{% for story in series.stories %}{{ storyCard(story, contentData.series) }}{% endfor %}</div><div class="empty-state" data-empty hidden><h2>没有符合条件的故事</h2><p>试试减少标签，或把难度切回「全部」。</p><button type="button" class="button" data-clear-filters>清除标签与难度</button></div>{% else %}<div class="empty-state"><h2>这个场景正在准备</h2><p>内容与故事正在供稿中。你可以先读首发的市场与周期、第一笔工资或买房与负债。</p><a class="button" href="{{ '/series/markets-cycles/' | url }}">先读市场与周期</a></div>{% endif %}</div>
